      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Dummy18",
      "garbage": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_WhatWasPokemonsName",
      "en_US": [
        "What was that Pokémon’s name now...?\n",
        "Oh, it’s on the tip of my tongue!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_AreYouTakingChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "This park is so scintillating!\r",
        "Trainers and Pokémon are so full of\n",
        "intensity here!\r",
        "Are you here to catch some, too?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_WelcomeToPalPark_PlayerMale",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to Pal Park!\r",
        "This is where top-notch Trainers come\n",
        "to demonstrate their Pokémon-catching\f",
        "techniques to their peers.\r",
        "...Oh?\r",
        "Are you maybe...\n",
        "Ah, you are {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "We’ve all heard rumors about you!\n",
        "Word is, you’re a hotshot Trainer?!\r",
        "We’d be honored if you would\n",
        "participate in our Catching Shows."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_WelcomeToPalPark_PlayerFemale",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to Pal Park!\r",
        "This is where top-notch Trainers come\n",
        "to demonstrate their Pokémon-catching\f",
        "techniques to their peers.\r",
        "...Oh?\r",
        "Are you maybe...\n",
        "Ah, you are {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "We’ve all heard rumors about you!\n",
        "Word is, you’re a hotshot Trainer?!\r",
        "We’d be honored if you would\n",
        "participate in our Catching Shows."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_LetMeExplainPalPark",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes! You agreed to participate!\n",
        "It’s a happy day for me!\r",
        "Let’s not waste any time!\n",
        "Let me explain how Pal Park works.\r",
        "I wrote the Pal Park manual for\n",
        "situations just like this.\r",
        "What should I explain?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Manual_BasicRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Pal Park is a place where you are\n",
        "timed on the catching of six Pokémon.\r",
        "You are provided with six special\n",
        "Poké Balls for the challenge.\r",
        "Participating Trainers are required to\n",
        "supply the six Pokémon that are to\f",
        "be caught.\r",
        "If you do not supply the stock of six\n",
        "Pokémon, you may not participate in\f",
        "the Catching Show.\r",
        "...Do you want me to explain anything\n",
        "else?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Manual_CatchingShow",
      "en_US": [
        "At the start of the Catching Show,\n",
        "you will be given six Park Balls.\r",
        "Use the Park Balls to catch the\n",
        "six Pokémon you provide.\r",
        "...Do you want me to explain anything\n",
        "else?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Manual_StockingPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "You may make Pokémon migrate from\n",
        "Kanto or Hoenn. Doing so will stock\f",
        "your Catching Game.\r",
        "Insert a Game Boy Advance Pokémon\n",
        "Ruby, Sapphire, Emerald, FireRed,\f",
        "or LeafGreen in the Game Pak slot.\r",
        "When your DS is turned on, currently\n",
        "caught Pokémon can migrate from\f",
        "the Game Pak to the DS Game Card.\r",
        "...Do you want me to explain anything\n",
        "else?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Manual_Stocking2_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon caught in Sinnoh may also\n",
        "be used to stock your Catching Game.\r",
        "Please ask the guy next to me who’s\n",
        "in charge of stocking Pokémon.\r",
        "...Do you want me to explain anything\n",
        "else?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_TakePartInCatchingShow",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to take part in\n",
        "a Catching Show now?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_AwwThatsTooBad",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww, that’s too bad.\r",
        "Well, just give me a shout if you’d\n",
        "like to participate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Greeting_PlayerMale",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi there, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Did you come to participate in\n",
        "a Catching Show?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Greeting_PlayerFemale",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi there, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Did you come to participate in\n",
        "a Catching Show?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_HereParkBalls_PlayerMale",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, here are your Park Balls!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "six Park Balls.\r",
        "The current record holder is\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} with {STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0} points.\r",
        "OK, off you go, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Dazzle us with a masterful display\n",
        "of Pokémon catching!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_HereParkBalls_PlayerFemale",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, here are your Park Balls!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "six Park Balls.\r",
        "The current record holder is\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} with {STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0} points.\r",
        "OK, off you go, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Dazzle us with a masterful display\n",
        "of Pokémon catching!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_NotEnoughPokemonMigrated",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hold on. You don’t have enough\n",
        "Pokémon for a Catching Show.\r",
        "You’ll need to stock us with six\n",
        "Pokémon to participate.\r",
        "You should make some Pokémon migrate\n",
        "from Kanto or Hoenn!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_IllReadManual",
      "en_US": [
        "Very well, let me explain how things\n",
        "work around here.\r",
        "I’ll read to you from the Pal Park\n",
        "manual I wrote."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SorryYouRetired",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry you had to retire.\n",
        "We hope you try harder next time.\r",
        "I’ll take what Park Balls you\n",
        "have left.\r",
        "Next time, please do stay to catch\n",
        "all six Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_PCBoxesFilled",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, your PC Boxes are filled. You\n",
        "have no room for six more Pokémon.\r",
        "You won’t be able to accept them,\n",
        "even if you do catch them.\r",
        "Make enough room in a PC Box and\n",
        "come back for your Catching Show."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_AllSixPokemonCaught",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "That’s all six Pokémon caught!\r",
        "The audience sure enjoyed watching\n",
        "your Catching Show.\r",
        "All right, let’s see your all-important\n",
        "score from this show!\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Catching Points: {STRVAR_1 53, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Time Points: {STRVAR_1 53, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Type Points: {STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0}!\r",
        "The total is...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 53, 3, 0} points!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_OutstandingRecord",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow! That’s an outstanding record!\n",
        "Kudos to you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_DecentRecord",
      "en_US": [
        "Good! That’s a decent record.\n",
        "Props to you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_AskStoreCaughtMon",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to put all the Pokémon\n",
        "you’ve caught in PC Boxes?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_PokemonHaveBeenBoxed",
      "en_US": [
        "Done!\n",
        "Your Pokémon have been boxed away.\r",
        "You’ll now have to save the game.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_GoForBetterScore",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, then it might be fun for you to\n",
        "go for an even better score by\f",
        "trying to catch these six again.\r",
        "If you want to do another Catching\n",
        "Show, just come see us!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_ComeSeeUsAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "If you want to do another Catching\n",
        "Show, come see us again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_TimeForPrize",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s time for your prize!\n",
        "Here you are!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_AskRedoCatchingShow",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to do another Catching\n",
        "Show with the same Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
