    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_CameToSeeCatchingShow",
      "en_US": [
        "Daddy says the Pokémon here came\n",
        "from faraway regions.\r",
        "I want to see a white Vulpix!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_YourCatchingShowWasFantastic",
      "en_US": [
        "Eek! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Your Catching Show was fantastic!\r",
        "I hope I can become an expert\n",
        "Trainer like you one day!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_IHopeYouDoBetter",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I hope you do better next time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_DaughterIsBigFan",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, my daughter is a big\n",
        "fan of yours.\r",
        "A day doesn’t go by without her\n",
        "demanding we come to the park."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_RareAndExoticPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "People come here to see Pokémon\n",
        "from far-off regions.\r",
        "Some look nothing like the ones\n",
        "we know in Sinnoh!\r",
        "The excitement gets me all jacked up!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_CurrentRecordHolder",
      "en_US": [
        "Each region’s Pokémon keep to\n",
        "their own corner of the park.\r",
        "Have you visited all four?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Topped2000Points",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You’ve topped 2,000 points!\n",
        "You’ve earned this, then!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_KeepWorkingHighScore",
      "en_US": [
        "Keep working on getting a higher\n",
        "score!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Topped2500Points",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You’ve topped 2,500 points!\n",
        "You’ve earned this, then!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Topped3000Points",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You’ve topped 3,000 points!\n",
        "You’ve earned this, then!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Topped3500Points",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You’ve earned 3,500 points!\n",
        "You’ve earned this, then!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_IncredibleRecord",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve set an incredible record!\n",
        "There’s nothing left to say!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_BagIsFull",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full.\n",
        "You should come back later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_RarePokemonTakeLonger",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve heard Trainers say the\n",
        "evolved Pokémon here are rare.\r",
        "And the birds from Galar?\n",
        "Hardly anyone has seen them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_ClashTrainerAndPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon in the park...\r",
        "They look like ones we know, but\n",
        "they’re different in every way!\r",
        "I especially look forward to seeing\n",
        "the ones from Alola and Galar.\r",
        "But it tugs at my heartstrings to\n",
        "know they’re so far away from home."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_MustCrownYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Your performance left my heart\n",
        "aflutter today...\r",
        "I must crown you with this...\n",
        "Crown.\r",
        "Oh, before you get the wrong idea,\n",
        "it’s an Accessory for Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_CompelledToGiveTiara",
      "en_US": [
        "Your performance left my heart\n",
        "aflutter today...\r",
        "I feel compelled to give you this\n",
        "Tiara.\r",
        "Oh, before you get the wrong idea,\n",
        "it’s an Accessory for Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_TakeThisSeafloorBackdrop",
      "en_US": [
        "Your performance left my heart\n",
        "aflutter today...\r",
        "I wish you would take this\n",
        "“Seafloor” Backdrop.\r",
        "Please try using it when dressing up\n",
        "your Pokémon with Accessories.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_TakeThisUndergroundBackdrop",
      "en_US": [
        "Your performance left my heart\n",
        "aflutter today...\r",
        "I wish you would take this\n",
        "“Underground” Backdrop.\r",
        "Please try using it when dressing up\n",
        "your Pokémon with Accessories.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_TakeThisSkyBackdrop",
      "en_US": [
        "Your performance left my heart\n",
        "aflutter today...\r",
        "I wish you would take this\n",
        "“Sky” Backdrop.\r",
        "Please try using it when dressing up\n",
        "your Pokémon with Accessories.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_CatchingShowsAndContests",
      "en_US": [
        "Not only is there this park,\n",
        "there are also Pokémon Contests...\r",
        "It’s so dreamy...\n",
        "Sinnoh sets my heart aflutter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Dummy73",
      "garbage": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Dummy74",
      "garbage": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignWelcome",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Regional Forms Park!\r",
        "Pokémon in forms from far-off\n",
        "regions have been gathering here.\r",
        "Nobody knows how they got here,\n",
        "but they seem to like it!\r",
        "Would you like to go in?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignZones",
      "en_US": [
        "Each region’s forms keep to their\n",
        "own part of the park.\r",
        "Alola’s are in the field, Galar’s\n",
        "in the forest, Hisui’s on the\f",
        "mountain and Paldea’s out at sea.\r",
        "Bring your own Poké Balls. Enjoy!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignComeAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Please come again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachGreeting",
      "en_US": [
        "Greetings. The Pokémon of\n",
        "the Regional Forms Park are a\r",
        "sight to behold, are they not?\r",
        "My name is Darach, and to my\n",
        "left is my employer, Lady Caitlin.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignCaitlinIsTrainer",
      "en_US": [
        "Caitlin: ...\n",
        "Darach! This person is a Trainer, yes?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachYesMyLady",
      "en_US": "Darach: Yes, my lady. I believe so.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachBattleCastle",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Lady Caitlin is the owner of\n",
        "the Battle Castle, you see.\r",
        "You will find that she can be very\n",
        "taken by superlative battles.\r",
        "However, for a reason I’m not able to\n",
        "disclose, Lady Caitlin cannot battle\f",
        "you herself.\r",
        "Consequently, I partake in battle\n",
        "in her ladyship’s place.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachRequestBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Lady Caitlin would very much\n",
        "appreciate viewing a Pokémon battle.\r",
        "As such, I would like to humbly request\n",
        "that you and I partake in one now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: That is a disappointment...\n",
        "Do you feel your Pokémon aren’t ready?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachEnGarde",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Let me assure you that you\n",
        "won’t be shortchanged by facing me.\r",
        "En garde!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Bravo! My hat’s off to you.\r",
        "I shall see to appeasing Lady Caitlin’s\n",
        "displeasure at my loss.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachLost",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Ah, a most valiant effort.\r",
        "Lady Caitlin is not one to accept\n",
        "defeat willingly.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_SovereignDarachEnjoyable",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: My lady, was this battle most\n",
        "enjoyable for you?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
